---
title: "obligation safety and liquidation eligibility (Current Finance: Market)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_calc_debts: debts_value_usd_for_liquidation
    q_calc_debts --> q_iter_debts: for each debt in obligation.debts
    q_iter_debts --> q_debt_price: price = get_price(oracle, debt_type, base_token)
    q_debt_price --> q_debt_value: debt_usd = debt_amount * price / 10^decimals
    q_debt_value --> q_weighted: weighted += debt_usd * borrow_weight
    q_weighted --> q_iter_debts
    q_iter_debts --> q_calc_collateral: collaterals_usd_for_liquidation

    q_calc_collateral --> q_iter_cols: for each collateral in obligation.ctokens
    q_iter_cols --> q_col_price: price = get_price(oracle, col_type, base_token)
    q_col_price --> q_col_value: col_usd = ctoken_amount * exchange_rate * price / 10^decimals
    q_col_value --> q_col_weighted: weighted_col += col_usd * liquidation_factor
    q_col_weighted --> q_iter_cols

    q_iter_cols --> q_check_safe: weighted_debts gt collateral_weighted?
    q_check_safe --> q_safe: obligation is safe (no liquidation)
    q_check_safe --> q_unsafe: obligation is unsafe

    q_unsafe --> q_check_bad_debt: collateral_total lte 1.01 * debts_total?
    q_check_bad_debt --> q_full_liq: bad debt -- close_factor = 1.0
    q_check_bad_debt --> q_check_min_value: debt_value lte close_factor_bypass_min?
    q_check_min_value --> q_bypass: small position -- no close_factor limit
    q_check_min_value --> q_enforce_cf: assert repay lte debt * close_factor
    q_full_liq --> [*]
    q_bypass --> [*]
    q_enforce_cf --> [*]
    q_safe --> [*]

    note right of q_check_safe
        INV-001: is_obligation_safe uses collateral_factor for borrow/withdraw checks
        INV-002: liquidation uses liquidation_factor (higher than collateral_factor)
        INV-003: borrow_weight amplifies debt for risk calculation
        INV-004: EMA-spot tolerance check only applies to borrow/withdraw, not liquidation
        INV-005: Bad debt bypass allows full liquidation when collateral ~ debt value
        INV-006: close_factor_bypass_min_value exempts small positions from close_factor
    end note
